rs to this Office.","line":11,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-1-2-1-2437ac03","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"1","text":"12:37–12:52","n":"1","kind":"video","target_doc":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002","target_page":"13","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 12:37–12:52","status":"verified","target_quote":"They’re investigators … They are career prosecutors and the Bureau of Criminal Apprehension. We just brought a bunch of cases this week","line":12,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-1-1-1-7e44a3be","violations":[],"warnings":[],"passage":{"oracle":"mirror","retry":null,"wrapped":false,"pages":[{"page":12,"pdf":12,"text":"They're investigators, and I'm proud of the work that they do. And quite frankly, Mr. Schutz, I find it offensive for you to insult these people. They are career prosecutors and the Bureau of Criminal Apprehension. We just brought a bunch of cases this week"}]},"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":13,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":{"pdf":13,"by":"clock","key":"at 12:37–12:52","file":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002.md","seconds":757,"end_seconds":772,"pdf_end":13},"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"1","text":"21:19","n":"1","kind":"video","target_doc":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002","target_page":"22","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 21:19","status":"verified","target_quote":"I also am assisting local prosecutors in the investigation and in one case, prosecution of the people who were shot by ICE agents","line":13,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-1-1-1-7bcf8582","violations":[],"warnings":[],"passage":{"oracle":"mirror","retry":null,"wrapped":false,"pages":[{"page":21,"pdf":21,"text":"I also am assisting local prosecutors in the investigation and in one case, prosecution of the people who were shot by ICE agents"}]},"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":22,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":{"pdf":22,"by":"clock","key":"at 21:19","file":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002.md","seconds":1279,"end_seconds":null,"pdf_end":null},"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"1","text":"25:24","n":"1","kind":"video","target_doc":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002","target_page":"26","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 25:24","status":"verified","target_quote":"Yes, we’re going to investigate.","line":14,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-1-1-1-e8ecd6aa","violations":[],"warnings":[],"passage":{"oracle":"mirror","retry":null,"wrapped":false,"pages":[{"page":26,"pdf":26,"text":"Yes, we're going to investigate."}]},"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":26,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":{"pdf":26,"by":"clock","key":"at 25:24","file":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002.md","seconds":1524,"end_seconds":null,"pdf_end":null},"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"1","text":"22:07– 23:26","n":"1","kind":"video","target_doc":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002","target_page":"23","target_page_end":"24","target_pin":"at 22:07–23:26","status":"verified","target_quote":"there needed to be a joint federal and state investigation … if it leads to prosecutions and the evidence warrants it, that’s what should happen … I am more than happy to lead the charge","line":15,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-1-1-1-d4074bf0","violations":[],"warnings":[],"passage":{"oracle":"mirror","retry":null,"wrapped":false,"pages":[{"page":23,"pdf":23,"text":"there needed to be a joint federal and state investigation of both of those shootings. That was back in January, 10 months ago. It's not as if I've recently come to this position. I was outraged by what happened there, called for a joint federal and state investigation, if you look, that probably didn't make me popular in certain circles in Washington, D.C., but that was the right thing to call for. It may be the only thing that that Keith Ellison and I agree on is that there had to be a joint investigation there. And wherever the facts lead out to that investigation, that's where they lead. And if it leads to prosecutions and the evidence warrants it, that's what should happen. > unwarranted, is illegal and it needs to stop. Ron Schuetz, how would you have responded to the agent surge at the time? Well, I'll tell you how I, in fact, did respond. Two days after the Alex Pretty shooting, I issued a press release calling for transparency, stating very clearly that for a government to have the confidence of its people, it needed to be transparent and that there needed to be a joint federal and state investigation of both of those shootings. That was back in January, 10 months ago. It's not as if I've recently come to this position. I was outraged by what happened there, called for a joint federal and state investigation, if you look, that probably didn't make me popular in certain circles in Washington, D.C., but that was the right thing to call for. It may be the only thing that that Keith Ellison and I agree on is that there had to be a joint investigation there. And wherever the facts lead out to that investigation, that's where they lead. And if it leads to prosecutions and the evidence warrants it, that's what should"},{"page":24,"pdf":24,"text":"[00:23:02] MOD: So you're saying you would continue to pursue possible prosecutions in the Renee Good and Alex Pretti? [00:23:07] RS: Absolutely. You got to remember, I started my career as a prosecutor. I don't want people coming into Minnesota shooting our citizens. And if they did so in a manner that was unjustified and criminal, they absolutely should be prosecuted. If that happens, I am more than happy to lead the charge"}]},"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":23,"target_pdf_page_end":24,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":{"pdf":23,"by":"clock","key":"at 22:07–23:26","file":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002.md","seconds":1327,"end_seconds":1406,"pdf_end":24},"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"1","text":"Ex. A at 2–3","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-001-02","target_page":"2","target_page_end":"3","target_pin":"at 2–3","status":"verified","target_quote":"You may contact the IC3 and make a request to investigate","line":16,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-1-1-1-0bc24c81","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page_end":3,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"1","text":"8:51–9:00","n":"1","kind":"video","target_doc":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002","target_page":"9","target_page_end":"10","target_pin":"at 8:51–9:00","status":"verified","target_quote":"we began to work with the FBI. And later there were search warrants executed. There was then indictments.","line":17,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-1-1-1-81663ad3","violations":[],"warnings":[],"passage":{"oracle":"mirror","retry":null,"wrapped":false,"pages":[{"page":9,"pdf":9,"text":"we began to work with the FBI. And later there were search warrants executed. There was then indictments."}]},"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":9,"target_pdf_page_end":10,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":{"pdf":9,"by":"clock","key":"at 8:51–9:00","file":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002.md","seconds":531,"end_seconds":540,"pdf_end":10},"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENC