1","file":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002.md","seconds":631,"end_seconds":null,"pdf_end":null},"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"22:07–23:26","n":"1","kind":"video","target_doc":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002","target_page":"23","target_page_end":"24","target_pin":"at 22:07–23:26","status":"verified","target_quote":"there needed to be a joint federal and state investigation … if it leads to prosecutions and the evidence warrants it, that’s what should happen … I am more than happy to lead the charge","line":49,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-1-d4074bf0","violations":[],"warnings":[],"passage":{"oracle":"mirror","retry":null,"wrapped":false,"pages":[{"page":23,"pdf":23,"text":"there needed to be a joint federal and state investigation of both of those shootings. That was back in January, 10 months ago. It's not as if I've recently come to this position. I was outraged by what happened there, called for a joint federal and state investigation, if you look, that probably didn't make me popular in certain circles in Washington, D.C., but that was the right thing to call for. It may be the only thing that that Keith Ellison and I agree on is that there had to be a joint investigation there. And wherever the facts lead out to that investigation, that's where they lead. And if it leads to prosecutions and the evidence warrants it, that's what should happen. > unwarranted, is illegal and it needs to stop. Ron Schuetz, how would you have responded to the agent surge at the time? Well, I'll tell you how I, in fact, did respond. Two days after the Alex Pretty shooting, I issued a press release calling for transparency, stating very clearly that for a government to have the confidence of its people, it needed to be transparent and that there needed to be a joint federal and state investigation of both of those shootings. That was back in January, 10 months ago. It's not as if I've recently come to this position. I was outraged by what happened there, called for a joint federal and state investigation, if you look, that probably didn't make me popular in certain circles in Washington, D.C., but that was the right thing to call for. It may be the only thing that that Keith Ellison and I agree on is that there had to be a joint investigation there. And wherever the facts lead out to that investigation, that's where they lead. And if it leads to prosecutions and the evidence warrants it, that's what should"},{"page":24,"pdf":24,"text":"[00:23:02] MOD: So you're saying you would continue to pursue possible prosecutions in the Renee Good and Alex Pretti? [00:23:07] RS: Absolutely. You got to remember, I started my career as a prosecutor. I don't want people coming into Minnesota shooting our citizens. And if they did so in a manner that was unjustified and criminal, they absolutely should be prosecuted. If that happens, I am more than happy to lead the charge"}]},"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":23,"target_pdf_page_end":24,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":{"pdf":23,"by":"clock","key":"at 22:07–23:26","file":"MN-VIDEO-MPR-DEBATE-20261002.md","seconds":1327,"end_seconds":1406,"pdf_end":24},"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"points 1, 2 and 4 above","n":"1","kind":"internal","target_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"point 1","status":"verified","target_quote":"1. The statute’s duty.","line":50,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-1-fbba5394","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"points 1, 2 and 4 above","n":"1","kind":"internal","target_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"point 2","status":"verified","target_quote":"2. Investigation.","line":51,"k":2,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-2-fbba5394","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"points 1, 2 and 4 above","n":"1","kind":"internal","target_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","target_page":"2","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"point 4","status":"verified","target_quote":"4. Prosecution.","line":52,"k":3,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-3-fbba5394","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"Minn. Stat. § 8.31, subd. 1 (2025)","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN-Stat-ch-8","target_page":"7","target_page_end":"8","target_pin":"subd. 1","status":"verified","target_quote":"The attorney general shall investigate violations of the law of this state respecting unfair, discriminatory, and other unlawful practices in business, commerce, or trade, and specifically, but not exclusively, the Nonprofit Corporation Act (sections 317A.001 to 317A.909), … the Prevention of Consumer Fraud Act (sections 325F.68 to 325F.70), and chapter 53A regulating currency exchanges and assist in the enforcement of those laws as in this section provided.","line":53,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-1-21c5a945","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":7,"target_pdf_page_end":8,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"Minn. Stat. § 645.44, subd. 16","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN-Stat-645.44","target_page":"3","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"subd. 16","status":"verified","target_quote":"\"Shall\" is mandatory.","line":54,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-1-6feb7228","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":false,"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"ECF 3-1","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"MN2594-003-01","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF 3-1","status":"mapped","target_quote":"","line":55,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-1-1c2fcb60","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_drop":null,"src_pdf_page":3,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10","src_page":"3","text":"Minn. Stat. § 8.31, subd. 2","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"MN-Stat-ch-8","target_page":"8","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"subd. 2","status":"verified","target_quote":"When the attorney general has information providing a reasonable ground to believe that any person has violated, or is about to violate, any of the laws of this state referred to in subdivision 1, the attorney general shall have power to investigate those violations, or suspected violations, and to take such steps as are necessary to cause the arrest and prosecution of all persons violating any of the statutes specifically mentioned in subdivision 1 or any other laws respecting unfair, discriminatory, or other unlawful practices in business, commerce, or trade.","line":56,"k":1,"unit_id":"MN-CORR-OPEN-LETTER-ENCLOSURE-A-2026-10-3-1-1-b866ae3d","violations":[],"warnings":[],"target_ligature_dr